.TH CJSON_LIST_LEN 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cjson_list_len, cjson_dictionary_size \- query composite node sizes
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cjson.h>

size_t cjson_list_len(cjson node);
size_t cjson_dictionary_size(cjson node);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
cjson_list_len() returns the number of child nodes of a CJSON_LIST
node, and cjson_dictionary_size() the number of key-value pairs of a
CJSON_DICTIONARY node.  Both call _ccol_fatal_err() when node is NULL
and when node is not of the type that the function reads.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
node  A CJSON_LIST node for cjson_list_len(), or a CJSON_DICTIONARY
      node for cjson_dictionary_size().
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The number of elements or keys, which is 0 for an empty list or
dictionary.  Neither function returns when node is NULL or of the
wrong type.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cjson_list_get (3),
.BR cjson_dictionary_get (3)
